From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Electron Agent Runtime <agent-runtime@electron.local>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 19:40:00 +0000
Subject: [electron] override WebGL and WebGPU adapter identifiers

An agent persona passes these values on the renderer command line. The
switches are absent unless that renderer belongs to a persona session, so
other processes keep Chromium's behavior. WebGPU strings are initialized once.
Nothing here is compiled in this change.

